        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_75654b450cd44db9b899e759b6f164de",
      "statement": "The bucket sink flushes when the time limit or the size limit is reached first, keeping a busy node's Parquet objects near the flush size instead of thousands of slivers per hour.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/telemetry.rs#L92-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:affb1de1143129e15dcd3f935fdfbcfc080e2c52de28f427a2f91797dcdb37a1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8b04a3c49a7846bf83c5c5e31ef0991b",
      "statement": "The sampler defaults to parentbased_always_on, and traceidratio/parentbased_traceidratio require OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG in [0, 1]; a parentbased sampler defers to the caller's sampled flag and decides only for roots.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/telemetry.rs#L140-L162",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3eb7ea46a5c19112acec4d38d3697a9d0f82bd2ae418075329cc818fca782eb6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4dccadc1192c479892faac60d86a7b1c",
      "statement": "celld records a span for each stateless Worker request, each cell event, each outbound fetch, and each cell start; records each console.log line with the trace id and span id of the handler so logs join traces across awaits; and reads and sends the W3C traceparent header to join the surrounding traces.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/telemetry.md#L35-L50",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3a2ef719d398485d5dc63965b3d55230e3fd4a9d8982d53d37d8e4f51f69dee1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5cd720969cf64ec5b7aac8a4be2f403f",
      "statement": "The telemetry hot path never blocks: record is a try_send, a full channel increments a drop counter, and under saturation telemetry sheds counted rather than shedding requests.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/telemetry.rs#L14-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1ce47b0c21e6bf2d931542407575120c8dbc8f00a63058debb7c1d80c971b28e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a71cbd09d8d74b7e8d8127e9ed05d7f0",
